0,- FOD_ID - Global unique identifier
1,- FPA_ID - Unique identifier for tracking back to original record
2,- SOURCE_SYSTEM_TYPE - Type of source database or system
3,- SOURCE_SYSTEM - Name or identifier of source database or system
4,- NWCG_REPORTING_AGENCY - Active NWCG Unit Identifier for agency
5,- NWCG_REPORTING_UNIT_ID - Active NWCG Unit Identifier for unit
6,- NWCG_REPORTING_UNIT_NAME - Active NWCG Unit Name for unit
7,- SOURCE_REPORTING_UNIT - Code for agency unit preparing fire report
