9,- LOCAL_FIRE_REPORT_ID - Unique incident report identifier
10,- LOCAL_INCIDENT_ID - Unique incident identifier for local organization
11,- FIRE_CODE - Code for tracking cost information for fire suppression
12,- FIRE_NAME - Name of the incident
13,- ICS_209_INCIDENT_NUMBER - Incident identifier from ICS-209 report
14,- ICS_209_NAME - Name of the incident from ICS-209 report
15,- MTBS_ID - Incident identifier from MTBS perimeter dataset
16,- MTBS_FIRE_NAME - Name of the incident from MTBS perimeter dataset
17,- COMPLEX_NAME - Name of the complex managing the fire
18,- FIRE_YEAR - Calendar year of fire discovery
19,- DISCOVERY_DATE - Date of fire discovery
20,- DISCOVERY_DOY - Day of year of fire discovery
21,- DISCOVERY_TIME - Time of fire discovery
22,- STAT_CAUSE_CODE - Code for statistical cause of fire
23,- STAT_CAUSE_DESCR - Description of statistical cause of fire
24,- CONT_DATE - Date fire was declared contained
25,- CONT_DOY - Day of year fire was declared contained
26,- CONT_TIME - Time fire was declared contained
27,- FIRE_SIZE - Estimate of acres within fire perimeter
28,- FIRE_SIZE_CLASS - Code for fire size based on acres
29,- LATITUDE - Latitude of fire location
30,- LONGITUDE - Longitude of fire location
